  "notes": [
    "Reflexive -AR verb based on *tratar*. Uses reflexive pronouns (me/te/se/nos/se) in all tenses.",
    "All conjugations follow regular -AR endings.",
    "In the phrase *tratarse de*, almost always used in 3rd person: *se trata de* (it's about / it involves).",
    "*¿De qué se trata la película?* (What is the film about?)",
    "*Se trataba de un malentendido.* (It was a misunderstanding.)",
    "Related: *tratar* (to treat, to deal with), *el trato* (treatment, deal), *tratar de + inf.* (to try to)"
  ],
